{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"一、四年，春王二月，莒人伐〈木巳〉，取牟婁。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"牟婁者何？〈木巳〉之邑也。外取邑不書，此何以書？疾始取邑也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"二、戊申，衞州吁弒其君完。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"曷為以國氏？當國也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"三、夏，公及宋公遇于清。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"遇者何？不期也。一君出，一君要之也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"四、宋公、陳侯、蔡人、衞人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"五、秋，翬帥師會宋公、陳侯、蔡人、衞人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"翬者何？公子翬也。何以不稱公子？貶。曷為貶？與弒公也。其與弒公奈何？公子翬諂乎隱公，謂隱公曰：「百姓安子，諸侯說子，盍終為君矣。」隱曰：「吾否，吾使脩塗裘，吾將老焉。」公子翬恐若其言聞乎桓，於是謂桓曰：「吾為子口隱矣。隱曰：『吾不反也。』」桓曰：「然則奈何？」曰：「請作難，弒隱公。」於鍾巫之祭焉弒隱公也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"六、九月，衞人殺州吁于濮。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"其稱人何？討賊之辭也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月，衞人立晉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_4_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_4","textTraditional":"晉者何？公子晉也。立者何？立者不宜立也。其稱人何？眾立之之辭也。然則孰立之？石碏立之。石碏立之，則其稱人何？眾之所欲立也。眾雖欲立之，其立之非也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}